lg:DK-227-2002-s7-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "c49b6e1ab89d7f2b5da17d4154b8968c7e4dcb7f6a9f9e17b187c52748980527" ;
    lgo:text """§ 7. A service provider shall provide information on
1) the service provider's name,
2) the physical address where the service provider is established,
3) an e-mail address and, where applicable, a postal address and other information about the service provider that makes it possible to contact and communicate with the service provider,
4) the CVR number, if the service provider is registered in the Central Business Register,
5) membership of any approval schemes, including the relevant supervisory authority."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-227-2002-s7-1-q1 .

lg:DK-227-2002-s7-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a976e4a4b9177ed8cfcac3b35e20e0ed38fc3fdb56288114d8af9163c09aa1e6" ;
    lgo:text """Stk. 2. A service provider practising a regulated profession shall additionally provide
1) information on any trade organisation or similar body in which the service provider is registered,
2) information on the professional title and the Member State in which it was awarded, and
3) a reference to the professional rules applicable to the regulated profession and how access to them can be obtained."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-227-2002-s7-2-q1 .

lg:DK-227-2002-s7-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a5d730c77edc25f8600ee93d4d8121bad8ba48db2f262d49212c3522c5746f1e" ;
    lgo:text "Stk. 3. Recipients of the service and the authorities shall have easy and permanent access to the information referred to in subsections 1 and 2."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-227-2002-s7-3-q1 .

lg:DK-227-2002-s8-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a33038cbbb7335bdae533c477d2c301ebce6ebc09d45dce41117654aa6c950c6" ;
    lgo:text "§ 8. Where information on the price of an information-society service is given, the price shall be indicated clearly and unambiguously. It shall be apparent whether the price includes taxes and delivery costs."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-227-2002-s8-1-q1 .

lg:DK-227-2002-title-43b5bd22e148-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "43b5bd22e148db16c1c246b6540a1430b5f0f2dad4c6e76fbf24b3f23805251f" ;
    lgo:text "Act on services in the information society (the E-commerce Act)"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-227-2002 .

lg:DK-BEK1148-s3-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "f56fb46c7c2da80d885104ca8779ddbadd0a5714d2e536cbbfff9157d334b84a" ;
    lgo:text "Natural or legal persons must not store information or gain access to information already stored on an end user's terminal equipment, or allow a third party to store information or gain access to information, unless the end user has given consent after receiving adequate information about the storage of or access to the information."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-BEK1148-s3-1-q1 .

lg:DK-BEK1148-s3-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "df127ff618278c4b80c87b2a17c7b8d5f44f188e0bca465b4e51b274d9a18427" ;
    lgo:text """Information within the meaning of sub-section 1 is adequate when it at a minimum
1) appears in a clear, precise and easy-to-understand language or equivalent pictorial script,
2) contains information about the purposes of the storage of or access to information in the end user's terminal equipment,
3) contains information identifying every natural or legal person that arranges the storage of or access to the information,
4) contains an immediately accessible means for the end user to refuse consent to or withdraw consent to the storage of or access to information, and clear, precise and easy-to-understand guidance on how the end user may use such a means, and
5) is immediately accessible to the end user by being communicated to them in a comprehensive and clearly marked way. In addition, when storage of or access to information in the end user's terminal equipment takes place through an information and content service, the information must be permanently accessible to the end user through a direct and clearly marked access on the information and content service in question."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-BEK1148-s3-2-q1 .

lg:DK-BEK1148-s4-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "7ecc469156b1ebf0609d5df394956ab6351645559b91253561112c2f58c01da3" ;
    lgo:text """Notwithstanding section 3, natural or legal persons may store information or gain access to information already stored on an end user's terminal equipment if
1) the storage of or access to information serves only the purpose of transmitting communication over an electronic communications network, or
2) the storage of or access to information is required to enable the provider of an information-society service expressly requested by the end user to provide that service."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-BEK1148-s4-1-q1 .

lg:DK-BEK1148-s4-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "3ed472253621e2b221edb8e1ed01f4e0d2880ce103da156729dc394e6fb20290" ;
    lgo:text "The storage of or access to information in an end user's terminal equipment is required for the purposes of sub-section 1, no. 2, if the storage of or access to information is a technical precondition for being able to provide a service that functions in accordance with the service's purpose."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-BEK1148-s4-2-q1 .

lg:DK-BEK1148-s5-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "ac41e3f9bf1fe83e32c6c26fdfce0244e47ddffed8246447275ca6c769172a18" ;
    lgo:text "Any person who contravenes section 3 is liable to a fine."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-BEK1148-s5-1-q1 .

lg:DK-BEK1148-s5-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "1d81212e48345a5d477c7f8e1450e06bc33fa51a5c2c93dbef6e5db8cd33b376" ;
    lgo:text "Companies etc. (legal persons) may be held criminally liable under the rules in chapter 5 of the Penal Code."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-BEK1148-s5-2-q1 .
